HEADS AA
START ** COMPARE ** SD

COMPARE #_ STOP ** SS
COMPARE _# COMPARE ** DD
COMPARE ## COMPARE ** RR
COMPARE == COMPARE ** RR
COMPARE |= BOTTOM *| SR
COMPARE =| TOP |* RS
COMPARE || BLEFT ** SS

BOTTOM |= BOTTOM ** SR
BOTTOM || BLEFT *_ SL

TOP =| TOP ** RS
TOP || TLEFT _* LS

BLEFT |= BLEFT *_ SL
BLEFT || BLEFT ** LL
BLEFT == BLEFT ** LL
BLEFT ## COMPARE ** DD

TLEFT =| TLEFT _* LS
TLEFT || TLEFT ** LL
TLEFT == TLEFT ** LL
TLEFT ## UP ** UU

UP _# DOWN ** DD
UP ## COMPARE ** SS
DOWN ## COMPARE ** DD
